== Another appendix section

After the last appendix-section comes the thesis' bibliography; its style is set
with the `bibliography-style` option in the Typst template. Then there are the
Hebrew parts of thesis, which don't exactly "follow" the bibliography in a
logical sense, but rather start at the beginning of the thesis when considered
as a right-to-left printed booklet. Thus, the last page of the extended Hebrew
abstract of the thesis comes right "after" the last page of the bibliography if
you're turning the pages in left-to-right order.
